    <h1>For the men and women who served. <em>$25/month off, or $500 off lump-sum.</em></h1>
    <p>If you served in the U.S. or Canadian military &mdash; active duty, reserves, or honorably discharged &mdash; you get a permanent discount on every plan I offer. No expiration, no fine print, no "first 90 days only." Thank you for the service.</p>
